-Iya.

00:01:55.962 --> 00:01:58.063
-Aku Cindy.
Senang bertemu denganmu.

00:01:58.735 --> 00:01:59.925
-Senang bertemu denganmu.

00:01:59.975 --> 00:02:02.744
